      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "As a quest user with steamvr, if you are using the beta, you can temporarily fix this issue by disabling gestures in the action menu > settings > avatar. If you are using steamVR, the steam hand poses will take over your avatars animations, and remote users will be able to see the steam hand poses, if you turn gestures back on, your hands will freeze as they were when you turned it on, and only you will be able to see your hand gestures again.\n\nThis is my experience, at least.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
