      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "All my avatars, which are a loooooot, have bent fingers sideways, it looks really bad, i hope they're working on a fix for index users, because on the live version its literally perfect.",
